This product includes software developed by PP Techs (https://github.com/pp-techs).

PP Agent is built on the Pi SDK (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), Electron
(https://www.electronjs.org), and other open-source packages listed in the package manifests;
their licenses are included in the distributed application.

The desktop app bundles OfficeCLI (https://github.com/iOfficeAI/OfficeCLI), a single-file command
line tool for Word, Excel, and PowerPoint files, and the skill texts that come with it
(apps/desktop/resources/skills/officecli*). OfficeCLI is Copyright 2026 OfficeCLI
(https://OfficeCLI.AI) and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its license, NOTICE,
and third-party notices are installed with the app in resources/licenses/officecli and are kept
in apps/desktop/resources/licenses/officecli.

The desktop app also bundles webclaw (https://github.com/0xMassi/webclaw), a command line tool that
extracts the text of web pages. webclaw is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3. It runs as a separate program that the app starts for each page; it is not linked into
the app and is not modified. Its license and the location of its source code are installed with the
app in resources/licenses/webclaw and are kept in apps/desktop/resources/licenses/webclaw.
